bottomparticipants

actor "User/Author" as A
boundary "Check-in Modal" as UI
boundary Router
control "CheckinController" as Controller
entity "CheckinService" as Service
entity "CheckinModel" as CheckinModel
database MongoDB

A -> UI : 1. View in Check-in Modal
activate A
activate UI
UI -> Router : 2. GET /api/checkin/status
activate Router
Router -> Controller : 3. getStatus(req)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : 4. getCheckinStatus(userId)
activate Service

Service -> CheckinModel : 5. findOneAndUpdate(upsert record)
activate CheckinModel
CheckinModel -> MongoDB : 6. Execute query
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> CheckinModel : 7. document
deactivate MongoDB
CheckinModel --> Service : 8. record
deactivate CheckinModel

Service --> Controller : 9. status (weekStart, checkins, canCheckin)
deactivate Service
Controller --> Router : 10. HTTP response (200 OK)
deactivate Controller
Router --> UI : 11. weekly checkin status
deactivate Router
UI --> A : 12. Mark / unmark for each day of weeek
deactivate UI
deactivate A
@enduml
